# Sweep along a path (an extension): New Group > Sweep Along Path with
# nothing selected says what to select; with the line, the bend and the
# line of the path picked, the active sketch's circle is swept along
# them, and the group screen lists the path. Analyze > Check Solid
# finds the pipe sound.
file $testdata/ui/sweep_path.tlspr
menu File|Open...
view other
answer ok
menu New Group|Sweep Along Path
dump
move 307.5 247.5
down L 307.5 247.5
up L 307.5 247.5
move 322.5 187.5
down L 322.5 187.5
up L 322.5 187.5
move 397.5 157.5
down L 397.5 157.5
up L 397.5 157.5
menu New Group|Sweep Along Path
dump
tw
answer ok
menu Analyze|Check Solid
dump
